 ker Kazuya Shiraishi's Edo-period drama follows a wandering ronin as he fa
 ces betrayal and revenge\, all building to a pulse-pounding finale.\n\nhtt
 ps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/bushido\n\nEstimated start: 16:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
